{"type":"text","timestamp":1794532297033,"sessionID":"ses_e2d8e5856ffeJngnOmzDuA3D1e","part":{"id":"prt_1d275c0c3002TCY73qwUDEYX81","sessionID":"ses_e2d8e5856ffeJngnOmzDuA3D1e","messageID":"msg_1d275a2d6001fD50oXRdt5RB7O","type":"text","text":"T017 is complete. The named verify command reports 7 passed and 0 failed.\n\n**File written**\n\n`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/gate1-pointer-sync.vitest.ts` is the only file touched. It now seeds `AGENTS.md` with a Gate 2 call line and a command line. The three added cases cover both blocks written with a clean `--check`, block one only with a stale command block removed, and a hand edit in the command block reported as `pointer block differs from the root AGENTS.md Gate 2 lines`.\n\n**Verify output** (`$G1T`)\n\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  7 passed (7)\n```\n\nThe baseline before the change was 4 passed, so the three new cases are the delta and the earlier four still pass.\n\n**Status**\n\nEdited, not committed, working tree dirty. The scoped diff is 66 insertions and 4 deletions in that one file. No other file was changed and the T017 checkbox was left unticked.\n\nNo inferred claim affects the result. Nothing is blocked on you. What I did not do is run any check beyond the test file the task names, and broader verification is the orchestrator's.","time":{"start":1794532294851,"end":1794532297033}}}
